Z||000000||martin1875||05-30-2001||12:51 AM||||i have a 92 bonneville with the 3800 sc and i need to change the supercharger oil and need to know how much it holds. i plan to put the engine in one of my fieros when i get to time and my shop built.||||reg||5
Z||000001||terryk||05-30-2001||01:05 AM||||Get two bottles. If it is complete drained (turkey baster and a hose), it will take one bottle, but I'd have a second one on hand. Fill it to the bottom of the hole. <P>GM part number 12345982. About $6 bottle.||||reg||1
